## Summary

Implements **GF-FR-007 Finance core v1** as an append-only tenant ledger.

### Ledger
- tenant-owned `revenue_allocations`;
- positive integer `amount_minor` + 3-letter currency code;
- source, occurred date, actor, optional beneficiary and note;
- no product update/delete path;
- corrections create one explicit reversal row referencing the original;
- reversals cannot be reversed and one original cannot have multiple reversals;
- net allocation is derived from originals minus reversals.

### Authorization
- Admin/Studio may view and manage Finance;
- Editor/Model are denied server-side;
- beneficiaries must belong to the active organization;
- cross-tenant listing and reversal attempts fail closed.

### UI
Adds a Finance workspace with allocation creation, ledger history, aggregate allocated/reversed/net values and explicit reversal actions.

### Safety
- deploy-before-migration GET remains readable;
- Finance writes return 503 until the schema exists;
- this slice does **not** implement payouts, invoices, taxes, payment-provider integrations or bank reconciliation;
- no production migration is applied from this PR.

### Required validation
`preflight · fast[contracts] · php-quality · PHPUnit · MariaDB · browser`

Legacy is intentionally outside this slice.

